          "_key": "5b13b1803ebb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Big news, graduates! In India, the University Grants Commission (UGC) now lets universities that are ready for it admit students twice a year, in July/August and January/February. For you, that can mean a second chance at a program if you miss the first cycle, and Admizz Education is here to help you plan for both."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
